[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1875.549, "timestamp": "00:31:15", "text": "哦，等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1887.75, "timestamp": "00:31:27", "text": "如果問題是關於名字出現的頻率，那麼答案是黑色。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1890.07, "timestamp": "00:31:30", "text": "肖爾或許能提出更好的治療方案。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1893.029, "timestamp": "00:31:33", "text": "或許"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1895.95, "timestamp": "00:31:35", "text": "為了使勒索者的手在研究中遭受損失"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1900.149, "timestamp": "00:31:40", "text": "沒有。更重要的是，今天我指望著你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1915.23, "timestamp": "00:31:55", "text": "夠了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1916.789, "timestamp": "00:31:56", "text": "哦，那很好。"}]